  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australian Development Investments (ADI) - Vietnam Climate Window - Investment Capital</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australian Development Investment (ADI) - Vietnam Investment Capital is part of the Australia-Vietnam Private Sector Clean Energy Investment Program (AV-PSCEIP).  ADI&apos;s Vietnam Climate Window will be implemented through DFAT&#x2019;s ADI climate finance strategy to crowd in private sector financing for SMEs and assist in the country&#x2019;s clean energy transition. The funding cap for the ADI Vietnam Climate Window is $13 million, which has been paid into the ADI trust. The window funding is made up of Bill 1 (technical assistance and expenses, $3 million) and Bill 2 (investment capital, $10million) appropriations. This investment is for Bill 2 - $10 million investment capital. Bill 1 funding for technical assistance and fees is housed under another program fund.</narrative>
  </description>
